        <mxCell id="k9mXl6RYws9MfLMmOEho-38" value="&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The LCS is an abstract class that has three child classes:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;GameSequence&lt;/i&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Level&lt;/i&gt;, and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Sublevel:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 18px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;*The&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;GameSequence&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;class is responsible for managing all the levels. It will possess all the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Level&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;nodes as its children nodes in the node tree.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;*The&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Level&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;class is responsible for representing a &quot;mission&quot; in the game. Think of missions in DMC or in Mafia (except for Mafia III), where a mission is a whole set of experience consisting of various smaller objectives. It will possess their corresponding&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Sublevel&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;nodes as their children nodes.&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;*The&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Sublevel&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;class is responsible for making up&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Level&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;nodes. Think of these as the rooms in Hades; many of these smaller rooms, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;Sublevels&lt;/i&gt;, make up a whole mission. They are also the ones that are responsible for instantiating map scenes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="1150" width="770" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k9mXl6RYws9MfLMmOEho-39" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;In the game, the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 20px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;GameSequence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-